    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "~WALK S\nCHALK'S INTERNATIONAL AIRLINES\nBimini, Bahamas",
      "CHALK'S\nTMTTMANIONAE\nThe World's Oldest Airline\nSince 1919, the airline that Albert Burns \"Pappy\"\nChalk founded has been shuttling passengers\nback and forth through the Bermuda Triangle\nbetween Miami and the Bahamas. It has never\nhad a fatal accident. It has never lost a plane.\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\nU.S. and CARIBBEAN PROMOTIONS"
    ],
